{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Guard against self-suppression during MDC restoration.** If End/preparation and `restore.close()` throw the same `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` instance, try-with-resources calls `addSuppressed` on that same object and replaces the worker\u2019s fatal with `IllegalArgumentException`. Close explicitly with an identity check, preserving the original fatal, and add a same-instance restoration test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77xzrR","finding_digest":"a22dea9c1f0f08987e676a629197e7281104398c414b33cec33fa6098f05463f","finding_id":"arf_v1_uiw6vha7b4ejq7thnjrjdf7hfa","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::same-fatal-mdc-self-suppression","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::same-fatal-mdc-self-suppression","line":304,"observation_digest":"8685d725b8ef008ed4db0452bf08dd81c4a007a8409ed7de6744cd58018b47b0","observation_id":"aro_v1_q2c5ojny54ai5vg3arjl6cg5qh","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:06:56Z","review_id":"arr_v1_e4ji4x6vtjringgtj3lklewnz3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"80110fc612416cc3162cb3c4a85f8439212aa8d8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":299,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_n2uc7mdkm6srn5bmia2smcxe5c","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:06:56Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
